                <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
                    Models, subscriptions, support periods and household needs change. A product that suits one home may be unnecessarily complex, incompatible or poor value in another. We confirm the problem and current requirements before recommending a category, model or plan.
