                    <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold">Diagnose before adding Wi-Fi hardware</h3>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-inverse-ink/70">
                        Router settings, placement, interference, cabling, internet-provider faults and coverage are separated first. If hardware is justified, the options may include a supported consumer mesh system or a managed access-point setup appropriate to the home.
                    </p>
                    <a href="/services/wifi-dropouts-ivanhoe/" class="mt-5 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-bold text-accent underline">Start with Wi-Fi diagnosis</a>
