                    <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold">One maintained system you control</h3>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-inverse-ink/70">
                        A reputable built-in ecosystem manager or maintained cross-platform password manager may fit, depending on the devices and recovery needs. Multi-factor authentication, unique credentials and a recovery plan matter alongside the application itself.
                    </p>
                    <a href="/services/password-manager-setup-ivanhoe/" class="mt-5 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-bold text-accent underline">See password-manager setup</a>
                </article>

