                    <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold">Supported systems and verified transfers</h3>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-inverse-ink/70">
                        Current operating-system tools, manufacturer updates and supported transfer methods are preferred. Important files need a usable backup, and a migration is checked rather than represented as successful merely because a copy process finished.
                    </p>
                    <a href="/services/new-computer-setup-data-transfer-ivanhoe/" class="mt-5 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-bold text-accent underline">See new-computer setup</a>
